1. Login Quay
2. Navigate to Organization -> Teams and Membership -> Click on "Owners"
![alt text](Images/q-image-2.png)
3. Provide permission of Oraganization to user
4. Repository
5. Settings -> Select User and Provide permissions
![alt text](Images/q-image-1.png)

Use Robot account
-------------

1. Login Quay registry -> Organization
2. Navigate to "Robot Accounts"
3. Create Robot Account
4. View it and save username and password.

If want to use it in docker then use that username and password. <br>
If want to use it in kubernetes then there is a help of it use it. <br>

